  <title>Research</title>
  <paragraphs xml:id="research-research-interests">
    <title>Research Interests</title>
    <p>Algebraic Geometry and related areas. I'm recently working on automorphism groups of hypersurfaces/hyperkähler manifolds. I'm also interested in moduli theory, quantum cohomology, Bridgeland stability and mirror symmetry.</p>
